# JRebirth core

Use JRebirth patterns first, plain JavaFX patterns second.

Keep role split strict:
- Application boots and configures the shell.
- Model owns UI state, bindings, and interaction logic.
- View builds nodes and delegates user actions.
- Controller wires MVC events.
- Command performs actions.
- Service handles long-running or backend work.
- Wave carries messages.
- Behavior is small shared cross-cutting logic.

Before creating or refactoring JRebirth code, read the matching skill.
